{"ID":"20240511105921-ssbnxpw","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","icon":"1f4d1","id":"20240511105921-ssbnxpw","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511105921-ssbnxpw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511105954-ua63uoa\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511105954-4sw5c3u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511105954-4sw5c3u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:15,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:15\u0026#125;","title":"汉唐中医方剂\u0026amp;汉唐100号","type":"doc","updated":"20240511125412"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240511105954-ua63uoa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-ua63uoa","updated":"20240511110003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪海厦的医案经常看他提 他的中成药汉唐某号。 故收录，格式化后转换成简体 如下。 除去广告色彩，对很多疾病的对证分析还是很有参考意义的。"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-j3e6miw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-j3e6miw","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐系列是采用纯中药制做的 , 完全无西药成分在内 , 并且中医是采用症状治疗法 , 也就是同症同治的原则因此辨症论治是必要的 , 并非依照西医的治病法则来治病 , 本文采用许多西医病名 , 目的是希望读者更容易了解中药的治症理论并且有助於开业中医的临床再进修 , 同业之间互相切搓 , 吸取前医的经验 , 不要再犯二过 , 使病人受到最好的照顾 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-rba569g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-rba569g","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"论文着作权人∶美国佛州汉唐中医学院，院长倪海厦中医师. 此方是我实际临床之经验方,不含任何有毒性的中药在内. 美国汉唐中医诊所专用处方."}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-06rdapf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-06rdapf","updated":"20240511110104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐系列\t3两 \t6两 主要功能"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-0hpjlgy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-0hpjlgy","updated":"20240511110057"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-1 24 48 \t\t\t中医名女性赤白带 (西医为子宫颈糜烂)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-2n66lwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-2n66lwg","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-2 24 48 \t\t\t退奶丸 (协助清除乳房硬块,停止喂乳必需品)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-t34anh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-t34anh2","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-3 24 48 \t\t\t记忆力减退萎缩"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-nt6p1xa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-nt6p1xa","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-4 24 48 \t\t\t鱼虾过敏 (皮肤红痒)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-tbsh6xw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-tbsh6xw","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-5 24 48 \t\t\t通乳丸 (乳房美化及令奶水集中於乳房)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-a6hlfbx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-a6hlfbx","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-6 50 100 \t\t\t手抖兼心颤栗 中医学九种心痛之一"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-ehvmtdk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-ehvmtdk","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-7 40 80 \t\t\t胃痈及胃出血(可参考西医学名胃癌与淋巴癌做比较)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-o1rupld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-o1rupld","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-8 40 80 \t\t\t子宫症痼(可以比较西医学之子宫瘤与多发性骨随瘤)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-plzy530","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-plzy530","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-9 24 48 \t\t\t血箭痔丸 (大便痔疮排血大量而无痛)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-n4z3skk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-n4z3skk","updated":"20240511110129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-10 60 120 \t\t大禹丸 (腹腔积水专用)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-rnpcvx1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-rnpcvx1","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-11 40 80 \t\t\t代抵当丸 (子宫乾血排不出,膀胱受伤小便 可出,但少腹如鞭)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-e6y61p3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-e6y61p3","updated":"20240511110132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-12 50 100 \t\t脱肛丸 (肛门下坠)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-xy8nak7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-xy8nak7","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-13 44 88 \t\t\t淋痛 (小便刺痛排浊)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-4gjdh2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-4gjdh2i","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-14 40 80 \t\t\t中医名胆石症(西医名胆结石)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-8ojzpol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-8ojzpol","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-15 40 80 \t\t\t真寒假热 厥四逆之症(其症类似於西医之血癌病)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-unc08hb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-unc08hb","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-16 40 80 \t\t\t皮肤乾痒癣"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-a59t60n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-a59t60n","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-17 50 100 \t\t湿疹脓疮"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-5m0idsf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-5m0idsf","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-18 50 100 \t\t中医名腰蛇 , 胸蛇 , 颈蛇 (如同西医名带状泡疹)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-fxlklg9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-fxlklg9","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-19 40 80 \t\t\t情绪焦虑不安 (如同西医之镇静剂 类)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-evhsqii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-evhsqii","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-20 40 80 \t\t\t治下肢无力 (老人双脚无力)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-sk0o6o0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-sk0o6o0","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-21 44 88 \t\t\t补阳还五丸 专治中风 (西医之脑溢血中风)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-z0efw1d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-z0efw1d","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-22 40 80 \t\t\t奔豚汤 (心脏速度过快,腹部悸动,焦虑惊悸)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-ewviq87","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-ewviq87","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-23 40 80 \t\t\t肝阳上亢 , 肾阳不足(可比照西医学之降血压)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-sbukav2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-sbukav2","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-24 40 80 \t\t\t中医上中下三消渴症(西医学之糖尿病) (饭後服)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-1ulu7k5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-1ulu7k5","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-25 40 80 \t\t\t中医药学之疏通经络剂 (如同西医学之三叉神经痛 颜面神经痛)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-oxscek6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-oxscek6","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-26 40 80 \t\t\t石淋,砂淋,小便带血 (西医学之肾结石)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-ltxr84n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-ltxr84n","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-27 32 64 \t\t\t中医症状偶发关节红肿剧痛名历节风(西医之痛风)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-mhf5qt6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-mhf5qt6","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-28 32 64 \t\t\t中医名风湿 (西医亦名风湿) 主要症状是关节变形肿痛"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-6bfmycp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-6bfmycp","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-29 32 64 \t\t\t消痔丸(大便後排一点血,胀痛)(西医学之外痔)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-4a80sp3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-4a80sp3","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-30 32 64 \t\t\t足三阳经之虚实痛(西医名坐骨神经痛)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-yrhogds","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-yrhogds","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-31 40 80 \t\t\t中焦湿热过盛(临床时可参考西医之三酸甘油脂过高)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-cbbsfil","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-cbbsfil","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-32 44 88 \t\t\t乌金丸 中医学九种心痛之一(主症:心痛澈背,背痛澈心)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-0ixtejk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-0ixtejk","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-33 40 80 \t\t\t中焦湿热过盛兼便秘(过重兼便秘)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-36ba97n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-36ba97n","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-34 40 80 \t\t\t补天丸 (掉头发 , 耳鸣)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-c2559t4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-c2559t4","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-35 40 80 \t\t\t紫金丹 (胸腔内伤 , 上身瘀血)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-lrx8gov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-lrx8gov","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-36 40 80 \t\t\t天青丸(妇女痛经) (兼治下身瘀血,受伤)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-rw2mvj3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-rw2mvj3","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-37 40 80 \t\t\t天威丸 (男性精子不足)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-o299xu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-o299xu4","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-38 40 80 \t\t\t玉华丸 (女性滋补良药)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-e5tw5b2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-e5tw5b2","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-39 22 44 \t\t\t鼻渊丸 (鼻塞不通,流清涕)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-b8t4zfx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-b8t4zfx","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-40 28 56 \t\t\t乌梅丸 (各种寄生虫,蛔虫)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-mofn80g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-mofn80g","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-41 22 44 \t\t\t中安丸 (失眠)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-e0jv087","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-e0jv087","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-42 40 80 \t\t\t控涎丹(痰阻塞胸肺,癫痫,中风痰涎阻塞)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-5vschag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-5vschag","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-43 22 44 \t\t\t麻子仁丸 (大便如羊屎,小颗粒状)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-bxlcoj3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-bxlcoj3","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-44 22 44 \t\t\t皂荚丸(清除肺中 吸烟造成之浊痰)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-0ngoo2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-0ngoo2s","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-45 24 48 \t\t\t己椒苈黄丸(右腹胀,肠间有水气,大便不出)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-0w1b2ez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-0w1b2ez","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-46 20 40 60/斤 \t六味地黄丸"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-u33wgvz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-u33wgvz","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-47 40 80 \t\t\t重阳丸(男子精中带血)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-l22cfdq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-l22cfdq","updated":"20240511110325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-48 22 40 80/斤 \t金匮肾气丸"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-8w12lh8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-8w12lh8","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-49 40 80 \t\t\t起阳丸(振奋阳气, 生精)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-x11inw8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-x11inw8","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-50 28 56 \t\t\t牙痛止痛剂"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-dxxs4bn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-dxxs4bn","updated":"20240511110332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-51 36 72 \t\t\t白内障内服"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-ks5m460","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-ks5m460","updated":"20240511110329"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-52 36 72\t \t\t赤丸(心脏闷,手足逆冷)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-bwj7vnt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-bwj7vnt","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-53 40 80 \t\t\t风引汤(中风瘫痪无力,尚可言语)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-aoqfr7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-aoqfr7o","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-54 40 80 \t\t\t喉蛾方 (可比照西医学之扁桃腺发炎)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-xlcnnrs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-xlcnnrs","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-55 17 \t\t\t紫云膏(皮肤生坚结)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-gxdusu9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-gxdusu9","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-56 5/罐(粉剂) \t\t汉唐红(外用伤口特效药)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-mv8iza5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-mv8iza5","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-57 5/罐(粉剂) \t\t佛州黑(外用烫伤特效药)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-isuje75","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-isuje75","updated":"20240511110342"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-58 25/罐(药水) \t白内障药水"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-qb0n6qh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-qb0n6qh","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-59 16/罐(粉剂) \t喷鼻药粉(鼻窦炎等鼻子过敏症)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-8pd3liu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-8pd3liu","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-60 40 80 \t\t\t强力天青丸(静脉曲张)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-pefues8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-pefues8","updated":"20240511110349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-61 20 40\t\t\t明目地黄丸"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-s4dcjnc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-s4dcjnc","updated":"20240511110356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-62 40 80\t\t\t沉香桂附丸"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-95aj2ti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-95aj2ti","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-63 40 80 \t\t\t中医学之骨损症(临床时可比西医学之骨质疏松症)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-qc6nxyj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-qc6nxyj","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-64 40 80 \t\t\t妇女经停後之身热盗汗,易生气,情绪不稳定."}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-knw05ex","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-knw05ex","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-65 40 80 \t\t\t血淋 小便 刺痛"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-smwc2yh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-smwc2yh","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-66 40 80 \t\t\t下焦寒湿症,膀胱无力 排尿 小便後须臾又来(女人遗尿)(类似於西医学之摄护腺肥大与膀胱括约肌失调)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-fhjnvp6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-fhjnvp6","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-67 40 80 \t\t\t失心丸(中医名为癫痫发狂)中医学九种心痛之一"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-1gh8b1w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-1gh8b1w","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-68 40 80 \t\t\t护肝丸"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-gqdwwpe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-gqdwwpe","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-69 40 80 \t\t\t中医名积水(主症是下肢水肿)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-tjqkf9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511105954-tjqkf9v","updated":"20240511105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐-70 40 80 \t\t\t定心丸 中医之心肾不交(主症是有焦虑,忧郁 之情志)"}]},{"ID":"20240511105954-noksdce","T